  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "A long sword of the Citadel's own pattern, re-hilted about your sealed oath by Hallas the Oathkeeper and given back with the wax still whole in the pommel. It is the mark of one who has kept the first of the oath of the West. Greater charges are spoken of -- the Pelennor, the Black Gate, the Witch-king's ending -- but are not laid upon it yet."
    }
  },
  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "A plain long sword of Gondorian make, its pommel closed about a folded parchment and an unbroken seal. No greater charge is set upon it yet."
    }
  },
